      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# PART 2 - Render references and cards\n\nThis step is shared by the LTX 2.5 and MiniMax H3 pipelines; both video backends use the same saved cards.\n\n**1. Pick the run** created by Part 1. `<< newest run >>` follows the latest run; reload the browser to see a new run in the explicit folder list.\n\n**2. Render references.** Part 1 decided which characters, locations, and recurring props the song needs. Each reference renders as a turnaround sheet. The first view of each reference is assigned to matching cards.\n\n**3. Save the sheet.** Reference images and `references.txt` are written under `<run>/references/`.\n\n**4. Render all cards.** Each card uses its assigned reference so the cast and locations remain consistent. `reference_strength` controls the match: 0 ignores the reference, 1 follows it closely, and 0.5 is a practical starting point.\n\nThe included image graph uses Z-Image Turbo at 8 steps and CFG 1.0. Replace it with another compatible image model if desired.\n\n**5. Review the deck.** When every required card is present, enable `approve_cards`. Then open the matching Part 3 workflow for LTX 2.5 or MiniMax H3."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
